'''Marked for Death''' is a [[Skyrim:Dragon Shouts|shout]] that temporarily reduces an enemy's health and [[Skyrim:Armor Rating|armor rating]], making them more vulnerable to physical damage. Each word further decreases the target's armor rating by 25 points, which means they will take 3% extra physical damage per word. All three ranks have a duration of 60 seconds.

This shout's effects can be mitigated or amplified by the target's [[SR:Resist Magic|magic resistance]].

